    "chunk_text": "Of Jacobe, Johannes Bro\u00f0er. \u00d0\u00e6t Judeissce folc brohte \u00fean hundredes ealdren feo, for \u00fey \u00fe\u00e6t heo mosten Jacoben swa ateon swa heo Heo genamen hine \u00fea & hine geh\u00e6ften. \u00dea wear\u00f0 mycel geflit betwux \u00fean cristenan & \u00fean h\u00e6\u00f0enan. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 sum \u00fe\u00e6t hit riht w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t man l\u00e6dde Jacoben for\u00f0 to heora gesamnunge, & geherdan his word \u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea sunderhalgen to Jacobe, Hwy bodest \u00feu \u00feone H\u00e6lend, \u00fee w\u00e6s ahangen, swa swa we ealle Jacobus so\u00f0lice w\u00e6s afylled mid \u00fean Halgen Gaste, & heom to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gehyre\u00f0 nu bro\u00f0re \u00fea leofeste, Ure Drihten behet Abrahame ure f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6t on his s\u00e6de by\u00f0 yrfeweardod ealle \u00feeoden. So\u00f0lice his s\u00e6d n\u00e6s na ofer Ismaele, ac ofer Isaac, swa swa God sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Abrahame, On Isaac by\u00f0 & so\u00f0lice ure f\u00e6der Abraham w\u00e6s geteald to Godes freond \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee he embsny\u00f0en w\u00e6re, & \u00e6r \u00fean Gyf \u00feonne Abraham is geworden Godes freond gelyfende, hwy mycele swy\u00f0ere by\u00f0 se Godes feond \u00fee \u00dea Judees cw\u00e6don, Hw\u00e6t is se \u00fee ne gelef\u00f0 on God? Jacobus andswerode, Se \u00fee ne gelef\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t on Abrahames cynne by\u00f0 geerfeweard ealle \u00feeode, & se \u00fee \u00deiss he forewitegode \u00feurh God sylfne & \u00feurh his wissunge. Eft Isaias forewytegode beo ures Drihtenes tocyme & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Efne",
